//! Big Picture's tab button icons: inline SVG on a 24-unit grid, drawn by `bigpicture.css`
//! in either style the `bigpicture_icon_style` setting picks (`icons-color`, `icons-outline`
//! on the frame). Each shape carries a class the styles fill or stroke: `f` body, `s` outer
//! lines, `d` inner detail, `cs` the colour style's own picture (Titles' scene), `cb` a
//! coloured button, `pd` a D-pad, `sd` sand, `tx` a tag's text. Colours are `--c-*` in the
//! stylesheet; `--ic` is each icon's own.
//!
//! Generated from the icon sample sheet; change the drawing there, not by hand.

